// Tell (tier 1), the Car Hugger: "a heavy grinding from the rear" (GDD v1.1 App. A.3), 60-300 Hz (the band the Weight
// held). Something clamped on the rear car and chewing its shell, in slow uneven heaves the wheels never make: a low
// groaning rasp with a sub-bass tearing under it, from the back of the train. Low, like the bed, so it's the heave and the
// tearing that tell it apart.
{
  "tier": 1, "loop": true, "maxInstances": 1, "minDistance": 4, "maxDistance": 120, "gainDb": 10,
  "layers": [
    { "source": "noise", "gain": 1.0,
